{"overview":"جنگجویان افسانه‌ای اک باتلر، تایریس فلیر و گیلیوس تاندرهد برای نجات یوریا از اژدهای غول‌پیکر مرگ‌مار، که هرگز نمی‌میرد، دوباره متحد می‌شوند؛ اما مأموریتشان با همپتون اسکویب، ماجراجویی تازه‌کار و به‌طرز وحشیانهٔ ناتوان که آرزوی قهرمانی‌اش فراتر از توانایی‌هایش است، پیچیده می‌شود. آن‌ها با وجود نقص‌های خود مجبور به همکاری می‌شوند تا راهی برای نابود کردن مرگ‌مار برای همیشه پیدا کنند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Legendary warriors Ax Battler, Tyris Flare, and Gilius Thunderhead reunite to save Yuria from the evil giant Death Adder, who just won't seem to stay dead. Their quest is complicated by Hampton Squib, an inexperienced and wildly underprepared adventurer whose dream of heroism far exceeds his abilities. Forced to work together despite their flaws, they must find a way to stop Death Adder once and for all.","tagline_en":"","runtime":20,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":10,"y":2026,"poster":"/toEwR5VTFzHmxW1pX1HjtTXH6QH.jpg"}],"episodes":10,"crew":["Mike McMahan","Joe Chandler"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP","US"],"cast":[{"name":"متیو ریس","role":"Gilius Thunderhead (voice)","photo":"/8uktKexgPn0tsW3dsXVNqkqiNh7.jpg","en":"Matthew Rhys"},{"name":"دنی پودی","role":"Hampton Squib (voice)","photo":"/w0zT8Y2dQHU8FgV03NJoHJE6tmD.jpg","en":"Danny Pudi"},{"name":"Lisa Gilroy","role":"Tyris Flare (voice)","photo":"/zEv5PRAKeQo7a3yCGhm2DJwf20B.jpg"},{"name":"Liam McIntyre","role":"Ax Battler (voice)","photo":"/vTw11F1awNW8AlxInljEsK96cNB.jpg"},{"name":"Carl Tart","role":"Chronos 'Evil' Lait (voice)","photo":"/tSGLxpTVzO3NotWtc3wkzNPdhlR.jpg"}],"trailer":"sStbBtfGaLA","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/252105-golden-axe/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Paramount Plus Premium","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/4N4BMd0Mm0kHAmF7RZgL5lW3cwc.png"},{"n":"Paramount Plus Essential","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uPWQPyF4nqwtfPNmGcFcenU57HG.png"},{"n":"Paramount Plus Apple TV channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/xu4LyKTwasTbta1Z0qWtZG4